<cl=F0F010>Conductor:<cl=00FF00> Ha! The old warrior will not leave his post! Well, your sword should calm him down.<br><br>

<cl=FFFFFF>Take the sword in your hand by clicking on it with the left mouse button.<br>
Use the left mouse button to strike with the sword.<br>
The target must be close enough to be hit.<br><br>
<l="hts:\\language\i_mainp.hts">Learn more...<\l><br>
